  "question": {
    "text": "The bob of the simple pendulum is given a vertically downward velocity of magnitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;as shown in the figure. The string can withstand a maximum tension equal to twice the weight of the bob and during motion the string breaks at an angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math>&nbsp;with the vertical. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;are smallest integers, then, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image33-6af253cd-e984-4fd4-904f-b108273cbf6f.jpg\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image34-a123c456-fd3d-4850-83b3-1ea8e04d6e0a.jpg\" /><br /><br />Let us assume that the length of the string is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
